Z||000003||Wolfhound||05-17-2001||02:11 PM||||I,ve snaged most waterside bushes in the southeast. I haven't fished in a while but sure do enjoy it. You can  find a cattle pond thats fished from the bank continuosly. Put a canoe in and fly fish from the middle to the bank and get more large bream than you can eat. I always liked a forward taper floating line and automatic reel.||||reg||1
